@* The "Details" part of a detail box (docs/06-dashboard.md, section 8 "Detail views", Marc 2026-11-13): facts without a
   state in a calm grid, the label above the value, an optional muted second line. Roles, groups and tags as tags;
   monospace only for builds, versions, IDs and thumbprints. A box without states holds only this part. *@
<dl class="fact-grid @(Embedded ? "embedded" : null)">
    @if (ShowLabel)
    {
        <div class="section-label">Details</div>
    }
    @ChildContent
</dl>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }

    /// <summary>Shows the "Details" label (when a StatusList stands above it).</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public bool ShowLabel { get; set; }

    /// <summary>Inside a table row or another container: no box corners.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public bool Embedded { get; set; }
}